    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Welcome to 6 The Drive, Station Manor, a truly magnificent family home that redefines modern luxury living. Built in 2018 and boasting an exemplary A3 energy rating, this exceptionally efficient property has been styled to absolute perfection by its current owners. Presented in flawless, turnkey condition, every inch of this home has been curated with high-end finishes, an eye for contemporary interior design, and an emphasis on space, functionality, and natural light.\r\n\r\nThe property offers excellent curb appeal and sits in an enviable position within the development. To the front, you are completely private and not overlooked. The home features a lovely, private driveway with ample space to comfortably park two cars.\r\n\r\nUpon entering the property, you are greeted by a large, welcoming entrance hallway that immediately sets a sophisticated tone. This space leads through to a stunning living room, where a striking feature wall serves as the elegant centrepiece of the room. Designed with modern living in mind, sleek pocket doors slide open from the lounge to reveal an exquisite open-plan kitchen and dining area. The kitchen comes fully equipped with all standard integrated appliances, an abundance of storage cabinetry, and a large central island that doubles perfectly as a breakfast bar for casual dining and hosting. Conveniently positioned off to the side is a generously sized utility room, offering excellent additional storage and plenty of dedicated space for both a washing machine and a tumble dryer.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the home continues to impress with beautifully proportioned accommodation designed for comfort. Each of the three first-floor bedrooms features high-quality built-in wardrobes, maximizing storage space. The primary suite is a luxurious, tranquil space complete with its own stunning en-suite shower room, while the main family bathroom is contemporary and beautifully styled with premium sanitary ware and finishes.\r\n\r\nThe top floor has been seamlessly expanded into a spectacular, light-filled attic conversion. Finished to an exceptional standard, this highly versatile bonus room is flooded with natural light courtesy of two large Velux windows and includes plenty of cleverly integrated storage space. It is ideal as a luxurious home office, a private home cinema, or an additional guest lounge.\r\n\r\nStepping through the sliding doors of the kitchen, you exit into a lovely, low-maintenance rear garden. Boasting a highly coveted west-facing aspect, the outdoor space receives a wealth of afternoon and evening sunshine. A standout feature of the garden is the large covered patio area, creating an exceptional space for year-round guest entertaining and outdoor dining. Complete with convenient gated side access to the front of the property, this entire setup makes the home absolutely perfect for seamless indoor-outdoor living during the long summer months.\r\n\r\nPositioned right in the heart of Dublin 13, Station Manor seamlessly blends relaxed coastal charm with rapid access to the capital. Enjoy zero-stress commuting with Portmarnock DART Station located just a short stroll from your front door, bringing you straight into Dublin City Centre in roughly 20 minutes. Spend your weekends strolling along Portmarnock’s world-famous \"Velvet Strand\" beach or cycling the newly developed Portmarnock-to-Baldoyle coastal greenway. You are also within short walking distance of esteemed local schools like Portmarnock Community School. Fantastic local supermarkets, boutique cafés, and world-class golf links are all right on your doorstep.\r\n\r\nWhile this home photographs beautifully, the photos simply do not do this property justice. It is truly a home that needs to be seen in person to fully appreciate its impeccable finish, sense of scale, and immaculate styling."
      },
